          "FCFF is the cash flow available to all capital providers (both debt and equity holders) discounted at WACC; FCFE is the residual cash flow remaining for equity shareholders after meeting operating expenses, taxes, reinvestment needs, and net debt service obligations, discounted at the Cost of Equity (K_e)",
