          "It mandates that the hostile bidder must immediately be arrested by market regulators.",
          "It allows existing target shareholders (excluding the hostile bidder) to purchase additional shares at a massive discount upon a trigger threshold, causing catastrophic economic and voting dilution to the hostile bidder's stake.",
